      "source": "https://www.sciway.net/city/lowrys.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was originally called Lowrysville for Parson Lowry, a local preacher who owned extensive property and lived comfortably.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.sciway.net/city/lowrys.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Train passengers once identified their location in Lowrys by passing Parson Lowry's large house with its grand white pillars.",
