        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.sciway.net/city/lowrys.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Carolina and Northwestern Railroad laid tracks through the Lowrys community during the 1840s for its route between Chester and York.",
